{
  "_readme": [
    "football-data.co.uk team name -> the FIFA/sofifa club name, per league.",
    "Values are passed through norm_club() before matching, so write the full FIFA name exactly as",
    "ClubSeasonExport emits it (see analysis/calibration/data/club_seasons.csv).",
    "A value may be a LIST when sofifa's spelling drifts between editions ('FC Koln' vs '1. FC Koln')",
    "— each candidate is tried against the season actually being matched, so extra variants are free.",
    "Only names normalisation can't resolve on its own belong here.",
    "Propose candidates for new misses with:  join_clubs.py --suggest   (then REVIEW — containment",
    "and edit-distance both produce false positives, e.g. 'Ath Madrid' -> 'Real Madrid')."
  ],

